  skos:definition "<div n=\"1\">— 6) нести, уносить, относить, приносить к кому-либо\n<ls>MBH. 3,11008.</ls> {#sarvaH prEzyajanastatra ratnAni viviDAni ca — ninAya#}\n<ls>R. GORR. 2,83,22.</ls> {#saparvatavanoddeSAm — laNkAmapi sanAgASvAM nayituM Saktirasti me#}\n<ls n=\"R. GORR.\">5,35,35.</ls> {#jAnAmi gamane SaktiM nayituM mAM ca te kape#} 40. {#AruhemAM mama SroRiM nezyAmi tvAM vihAyasA#}\n<ls>MBH. 1,5966.</ls>\n<ls>VID. 280.</ls> {#Sivena naya (aSva) mAM paTA#}\n<ls n=\"VID.\">31.</ls> <ls n=\"VID.\">37.</ls> <ls n=\"VID.\">28.</ls> {#nayasva — tvaM mAM tasyA niveSanam#}\n<ls>MĀRK. P. 16,19.</ls> {#taM taTA nIyamAnamavalokya#}\n<ls>PAÑCAT. 76,24.</ls> <ls n=\"PAÑCAT. 76,\">25.</ls> {#BUyo 'pi prayojane saMjAte tanmAtraM sametyAsmAtsTAnAnnezyAvaH#}\n<ls n=\"PAÑCAT.\">96,6.</ls> {#udDftyAliYjarAttasmAt — taM matsyamanayadvApIm#}\n<ls>MATSYOP. 14. 18. 20. 22. fgg.</ls> {#tarusTalaM (pipIlikAH) nayanti (aRqakAni) nimnAt#}\n<ls>VARĀH. BṚH. S. 94,59.</ls> {#Badra na sarvametadvittaM gfhaM prati netuM yujyate#}\n<ls>PAÑCAT. 96,4.</ls> {#kasyedamuSIrAnulepanaM mfRAlavanti ca nalinIpattrARi nIyante#} для кого\n<ls>ŚĀK. 31,7.</ls> {#kasyedaM nIyate toyam#}\n<ls>VID. 289.</ls>\n[Page4-0267]\nЗначение <ab>Bed.</ab> переносить (терпеть) слово, по-видимому, имеет в следующем месте: {#priyApriye cAtmasamaM nayIta#}\n<ls>MBH. 5,1264.</ls>"@ru ;
  pwglex:sourceGloss "<div n=\"1\">— 6) {%hintragen, wegtragen, forttragen, hintragen zu%}\n<ls>MBH. 3,11008.</ls> {#sarvaH prEzyajanastatra ratnAni viviDAni ca — ninAya#}\n<ls>R. GORR. 2,83,22.</ls> {#saparvatavanoddeSAm — laNkAmapi sanAgASvAM nayituM Saktirasti me#}\n<ls n=\"R. GORR.\">5,35,35.</ls> {#jAnAmi gamane SaktiM nayituM mAM ca te kape#} 40. {#AruhemAM mama SroRiM nezyAmi tvAM vihAyasA#}\n<ls>MBH. 1,5966.</ls>\n<ls>VID. 280.</ls> {#Sivena naya (aSva) mAM paTA#}\n<ls n=\"VID.\">31.</ls> <ls n=\"VID.\">37.</ls> <ls n=\"VID.\">28.</ls> {#nayasva — tvaM mAM tasyA niveSanam#}\n<ls>MĀRK. P. 16,19.</ls> {#taM taTA nIyamAnamavalokya#}\n<ls>PAÑCAT. 76,24.</ls> <ls n=\"PAÑCAT. 76,\">25.</ls> {#BUyo 'pi prayojane saMjAte tanmAtraM sametyAsmAtsTAnAnnezyAvaH#}\n<ls n=\"PAÑCAT.\">96,6.</ls> {#udDftyAliYjarAttasmAt — taM matsyamanayadvApIm#}\n<ls>MATSYOP. 14. 18. 20. 22. fgg.</ls> {#tarusTalaM (pipIlikAH) nayanti (aRqakAni) nimnAt#}\n<ls>VARĀH. BṚH. S. 94,59.</ls> {#Badra na sarvametadvittaM gfhaM prati netuM yujyate#}\n<ls>PAÑCAT. 96,4.</ls> {#kasyedamuSIrAnulepanaM mfRAlavanti ca nalinIpattrARi nIyante#} {%für wen%}\n<ls>ŚĀK. 31,7.</ls> {#kasyedaM nIyate toyam#}\n<ls>VID. 289.</ls>\n[Page4-0267]\nDie <ab>Bed.</ab> {%ertragen%} scheint das Wort in der folgenden Stelle zu haben: {#priyApriye cAtmasamaM nayIta#}\n<ls>MBH. 5,1264.</ls>"@de ;
