  skos:definition "<div n=\"1\">— 6) {%устанавливать, вводить в должность, учить; составлять (сочинение)%}: {#dyUte purARErvyavahAraH praRItastatrAtyayo nAsti na saMprahAraH#}\n<ls>MBH. 2,1977.</ls> {#triMSanmuhUrtaM tu BavedahaSca rAtriSca saMKyA muniBiH praRItA#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">12,8490.</ls> {#praRItamfziBirjYAtvA DarmaM SASvatamavyayam#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">13,2542.</ls> {#girimahastvayam . tvatpraRIto 'dya gopAnAM gavAM hetoH pravartyatAm#}\n<ls>HARIV. 3864.</ls> {#Darmo manunA praRItaH#}\n<ls>RAGH. 14,67.</ls>\n<ls>BHĀG. P. 6,3,19.</ls>\n<ls>ŚUK. in LA. 41,12.</ls> <ls>H. 25</ls>, <ab>Sch.</ab> {#BavatpraRItamAcAramAmananti hi sADavaM#}\n<ls>KUMĀRAS. 6,31.</ls> {#na matpraRItaM na parapraRItaM suto vadatyezaH#}\n<ls>BHĀG. P. 7,5,28.</ls> {#(Ayurvedam) BUyo 'zwaDA praRItavAn#} {%составлять (текст)%}\n<ls>SUŚR. 1,1,18.</ls>\n<ls>MBH. 1,591.</ls> {#kramaM praRIya SikzAM ca praRayitvA sa gAlavaH#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">12,13263.</ls> <ab>Schol.</ab> к <ls>P. 2,4,21.</ls> <ls>VOP.</ls> <ab>Einl.</ab> {#SAstraM ca yasyoSanasA praRItam#}\n<ls>PAÑCAT. V,76.</ls> <ls>ŚAṂK.</ls> к <ls>BṚH. ĀR. UP. S. 302.</ls> <ls>PRAB. 28,2.</ls> <ls n=\"PRAB.\">28,1.</ls> <ls>MÜLLER, St. 197.</ls> <ls>Verz. d. Oxf. H. No. 380.</ls> <ls>MADHUS.</ls> в <ls>Ind. St. 1,18,1.</ls> <ls>KULL.</ls> к <ls>M. 1,5.</ls> {#manupraRItatve 'sya SAstrasya#} <ab>ders.</ab> к <ls>M. 1,4.</ls>"@ru ;
  pwglex:sourceGloss "<div n=\"1\">— 6) {%feststellen, einsetzen, lehren; verfassen%}: {#dyUte purARErvyavahAraH praRItastatrAtyayo nAsti na saMprahAraH#}\n<ls>MBH. 2,1977.</ls> {#triMSanmuhUrtaM tu BavedahaSca rAtriSca saMKyA muniBiH praRItA#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">12,8490.</ls> {#praRItamfziBirjYAtvA DarmaM SASvatamavyayam#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">13,2542.</ls> {#girimahastvayam . tvatpraRIto 'dya gopAnAM gavAM hetoH pravartyatAm#}\n<ls>HARIV. 3864.</ls> {#Darmo manunA praRItaH#}\n<ls>RAGH. 14,67.</ls>\n<ls>BHĀG. P. 6,3,19.</ls>\n<ls>ŚUK. in LA. 41,12.</ls> <ls>H. 25</ls>, <ab>Sch.</ab> {#BavatpraRItamAcAramAmananti hi sADavaM#}\n<ls>KUMĀRAS. 6,31.</ls> {#na matpraRItaM na parapraRItaM suto vadatyezaH#}\n<ls>BHĀG. P. 7,5,28.</ls> {#(Ayurvedam) BUyo 'zwaDA praRItavAn#} {%abfassen%}\n<ls>SUŚR. 1,1,18.</ls>\n<ls>MBH. 1,591.</ls> {#kramaM praRIya SikzAM ca praRayitvA sa gAlavaH#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">12,13263.</ls> <ab>Schol.</ab> zu <ls>P. 2,4,21.</ls> <ls>VOP.</ls> <ab>Einl.</ab> {#SAstraM ca yasyoSanasA praRItam#}\n<ls>PAÑCAT. V,76.</ls> <ls>ŚAṂK.</ls> zu <ls>BṚH. ĀR. UP. S. 302.</ls> <ls>PRAB. 28,2.</ls> <ls n=\"PRAB.\">28,1.</ls> <ls>MÜLLER, St. 197.</ls> <ls>Verz. d. Oxf. H. No. 380.</ls> <ls>MADHUS.</ls> in <ls>Ind. St. 1,18,1.</ls> <ls>KULL.</ls> zu <ls>M. 1,5.</ls> {#manupraRItatve 'sya SAstrasya#} <ab>ders.</ab> zu <ls>M. 1,4.</ls>"@de ;
